OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas market fears as
OL,4,Aroadworks cause long delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoadworks are causing major disruption
OL,7,Fon one of the main routes leading to
OL,8,Fthe UK's largest Christmas market.
OL,10,FTemporary traffic lights have reduced
OL,11,FA36 Beckford Road in Bath to a single
OL,12,Flane, with people saying they are
OL,13,Fspending "hours sitting" in traffic.
OL,15,FBut residents fear the delays will
OL,16,Fbecome even worse when the Christmas
OL,17,Fmarket opens on 26 November and have
OL,18,Furgently called on council leaders to
OL,19,Freopen a route shut for the city's low
OL,20,Ftraffic scheme.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
