OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas market fears as
OL,4,Aroadworks cause long delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FBath and North East Somerset Council
OL,7,F(Banes) said it could not confirm
OL,8,Fwhether it would temporarily adjust
OL,9,Frules on nearby Sydney Road, which has
OL,10,Fbeen closed to vehicles since 2024.
